*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_LTE_UL_Test_Model_Activation_srsActivation_Fail
    [Documentation]
    ...  Starts LTE Uplink Test Model via admin API and waits for activation fail. Version for TDD and FDD radios.
    ...  Proper reason of fail is confirmed based on admin API response. Response should contain "LteL2TDDInvalidFRCForSRS" failed cause.
    ...  * REQUIREMENTS:  SCF parameter srsActivation must be set on True in test preconitions.
    ...
    ...  :param str test_model: (Mandatory) One of following LTE UL test models supported for cell configuration:
    ...                                     "A1-1", "A1-2",
    ...                                     "A1-3", "A1-4", "A1-5",
    ...                                     "A1-6", "A1-7", "A2-1",
    ...                                     "A2-2", "A2-3", "A3-1",
    ...                                     "A3-2", "A3-3", "A3-4",
    ...                                     "A3-5", "A3-6", "A3-7",
    ...                                     "A4-1", "A4-2", "A4-3",
    ...                                     "A4-4", "A4-5", "A4-6",
    ...                                     "A4-7", "A4-8", "A5-1",
    ...                                     "A5-2", "A5-3", "A5-4",
    ...                                     "A5-5", "A5-6", "A5-7",
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) : Global cell id of tested LTE cell.
    ...  :param int rep_time_interval: (Optional) : reporting time interval (in seconds), range <0 to 4294967295>, default 1.
    ...  :param int resource_block_offset: (Optional) : resource block offset, range <0 to 99>, default 25.
    ...  :param str digital_output_type: (Optional) : type of digital output, One of the following:
    ...                                              "BinaryHarq", "SerialAgilent", "SerialRs", default "SerialRs".
    ...  :param int tdd_spec_subf_conf: (Optional) : parameter required for TDD configuration, range <3 to 9>, default 7.
    ...  :param int tdd_frame_conf: (Optional) : parameter required for TDD configuration, range <1 to 3>, default 1.
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional) : timeout (in seconds) for test startup and termination, default 60.

    [Arguments]  ${test_model}
    ...          ${cell_id}
    ...          ${rep_time_interval}=1
    ...          ${resource_block_offset}=25
    ...          ${digital_output_type}=SerialRs
    ...          ${tdd_spec_subf_conf}=7
    ...          ${tdd_frame_conf}=1
    ...          ${timeout}=60
    [Timeout]    24 hours

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Create admin session with default alias                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${cells_params}                                         tm_setup_adm.get_cell_parameters_required_to_setup_test_model
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     cell_type=lte
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Robot Log Variable                                      Parameters required to TM start: ${cells_params}
    &{earfcn}                                               tm_setup_adm.get_earfcn_variables_for_lte_cell_id
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     sep_channels_for_tdd=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting LTE UL ${test_model} test model...
    ${start_test_result}                                    tm_lte_adm.start_lte_uplink_test
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${cells_params["distname_runtime"]}
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model.replace('-', '_').replace('.', '_')}
    ...                                                     earfcn=${earfcn['earfcn_uplink']}
    ...                                                     reporting_time_interval=${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                     resource_block_offset=${resource_block_offset}
    ...                                                     digital_output_type=${digital_output_type}
    ...                                                     tdd_spec_subf_conf=${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...                                                     tdd_frame_conf=${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Should Be Equal As Strings                              ${start_test_result['status']}
    ...                                                     Failed
    ...                                                     msg=LTE UL ${test_model} test model with srs active start succeeded: ${start_test_result['msg']}

    Robot Log Step                                          LTE UL ${test_model} test model with srs activation has failed.

    Robot Log Operation                                     Checking reason of failed...
    ${srs_activation}                                       tm_lte_adm.check_srs_activation_in_admin_api_response
    ...                                                     api_response=${start_test_result['msg']}
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Should be true                                          ${srs_activation}
    Robot Log Result                                        Start test failure message with srs activation in confirmed.

    [Teardown]                    Run keyword if            "${start_test_result['status']}"=="Success"
    ...                           Run keywords
    ...                           Robot Log Operation       Stopping LTE UL test model ${test_model}...
    ...                           AND
    ...                           tm_lte_adm.stop_lte_uplink_test
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${cells_params["distname_runtime"]}
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model.replace('-', '_').replace('.', '_')}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
